                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As I spell out in my DEFUND Act, the UN is a largely wasteful organization with many agencies the US shouldn\u2019t be funding. The Security Council is one of the few areas where a presence is in our national interest, from which we can prevent unjust treatment against our friends and allies. \n\nToday\u2019s move by the Biden Administration, allowing a resolution to pass with no mention of the civilian hostages, is inexcusable. This action caves to the demands of China and Russia, who bizarrely sit on the UN Security Council despite their open hostility to foreign nations.\n\nIt is clear the UN needs serious reforms and the Biden Admin must reverse course. #utpol\n\nhttps://t.co/eOyAzNFqqt",
